---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"Making Space Practice in Utah | Tangible Therapy"} description={"At our new Provo office, learn Making Space with Tangible Mental Health. Ride the Bus, breathe into emotions & reframe thoughts. Book your appointment today."}>
<section class="sec t-white h-custom">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top: calc(0vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(0vmax / 10);">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:11;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html jc" style="--d:3/8/7/20;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><div class="scaled"><span class="scaled-in"><h1><span class="c-darkAccent">Making Space</span></h1></span></div></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html je" style="--d:7/8/10/20;--m:4/2/10/10"><div class="rte"><p class="sm"><span class="c-darkAccent">Making space is a practice that changes the way our mind relates to our thoughts &amp; emotions. It’s a skill that’s important to help us realize, we are not our thoughts and emotions and in turn, disempowers them.  In order to effectively create space we need to reframe the way our brain currently interacts with emotions by consistently practicing the skills below. </span></p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:15;--mrows:27">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/3/14/13;--m:1/2/8/10"><figure class="img fill"><img src="/images/image-asset-397b7d.jpeg" alt="Interior of a bus with purple seats and red poles. A person in a dark coat sits, facing forward. Soft, warm sunlight filters in, conveying tranquility." width="2500" height="1407" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/16/14/24;--m:10/2/24/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-darkAccent">Close your eyes and visualize yourself on a bus. You are in the driver's seat. Picture the bus around you and the road that you are driving on. </span></p><p><span class="c-darkAccent">Breathe.</span></p><p><span class="c-darkAccent">As you feel your emotions, visualize them appearing on the road ahead of you. Approach them in your bus and pull over to welcome them on.</span></p><p><span class="c-darkAccent">Help them find their seats and allow them to sit down. When they’re seated, return your attention to the road ahead of you. Remember that when the emotion is ready to leave the bus it will.  </span></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:6/5/16/11;--m:3/4/10/8;--dz:3;--mz:3"><figure class="img fill"><img src="/images/image-asset-9368a6.jpeg" alt="Empty, blank white sheet of paper." width="1765" height="2500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:9/5/13/11;--m:5/2/8/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><h4 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Ride the Bus</span></h4><h4 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Visualization</span></h4></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:16;--mrows:27">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/3/14/13;--m:1/2/8/10"><figure class="img fill"><img src="/images/image-asset-746acb.jpeg" alt="Dense cluster of green, ribbed leaves with some brown edges." width="2000" height="2500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/16/13/24;--m:10/2/24/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-darkAccent">Close your eyes and allow your mind to scan down into your body. As it scans down notice any emotions or sensations that your body is experiencing. When you find uncomfortable emotions allow your attention to rest on those areas, resisting any urges you may have to struggle with those emotions. Instead, begin breathing deeply. Each breath flows to that uncomfortable space in your body like a cloud of self-compassion. Each breath in inflates that cloud a little more while each breath out relieves any tension or anxiety about that emotion. Remember the goal is to create space for you and your uncomfortable emotion to co-exist. </span></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:6/5/15/11;--m:3/4/10/8;--dz:3;--mz:3"><figure class="img fill"><img src="/images/image-asset-9368a6.jpeg" alt="The image is completely blank with a plain white background." width="1765" height="2500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:9/5/12/11;--m:5/2/8/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><h4 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Breathing Into </span></h4><h4 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Emotions</span></h4></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:14;--mrows:27">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/3/14/13;--m:1/2/8/10"><figure class="img fill"><img src="/images/image-asset-fd85e3.jpeg" alt="An aerial view of ocean waves crashing in the sea." width="2500" height="2000" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/16/11/24;--m:10/2/24/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-darkAccent">Thank your brain for allowing you to feel this emotion/thought and have this experience</span></p><p><span class="c-darkAccent">Simply notice your experience by saying to yourself “I’m noticing Im thinking/feeling…” </span></p><p><span class="c-darkAccent">Sing the thought to the tune of Happy Birthday</span></p><p><span class="c-darkAccent">Asking the Question “Is this thought/emotion helping me be the person I want to be?</span></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:6/5/15/11;--m:3/4/10/8;--dz:3;--mz:3"><figure class="img fill"><img src="/images/image-asset-9368a6.jpeg" alt="The image appears to be blank or has no discernible content." width="1765" height="2500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:9/5/12/11;--m:5/2/8/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><h4 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Cognitive </span></h4><h4 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Skills</span></h4></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
